designer_notes = "THE ARCHER CAUGHT (Luke's F3, 2026-11-12, FOES_PREP.md section 6): a slow kick that pushes you off it (its kit's hit: 6 m/s) for little damage (8 at 55 % = 4.4, about 15 % of an iron sword's). Blockable and parryable: a parry staggers the archer, and it is helpless in the kick's recovery. Kick at 0.9."
